# ============================================================================
# arunlinux — ArunDE Fusion desktop (XFCE core + LXQt light apps, debloated)
# .list.chroot files are installed INTO the live system by live-build.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What we KEEP from XFCE (the fast, stable core):
#   xfwm4 window manager, xfce4-panel, session, settings, screenshooter
# What we TAKE from LXQt (lighter than XFCE equivalents):
#   qterminal (lighter than xfce4-terminal), lxqt-runner (app launcher),
#   featherpad (light editor), lximage-qt (image viewer)
# What we DROP (bloat):
#   parole, ristretto, xfce4-dict, xfce4-notes, gigolo, orage,
#   mate/polkit agents we don't need, extra games, bulk print stacks
# ============================================================================

# --- Xorg + display manager ---
xorg
xserver-xorg-input-all
xserver-xorg-video-all
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter
lightdm-gtk-greeter-settings

# --- XFCE core (session, wm, panel, settings) ---
xfce4-session
xfwm4
xfce4-panel
xfce4-settings
xfce4-power-manager
xfce4-screenshooter
xfce4-taskmanager
xfce4-terminal
thunar
thunar-archive-plugin
thunar-volman
tumbler
gvfs
gvfs-backends
udisks2
policykit-1
polkitd-pkla
pavucontrol
pasystray
network-manager
network-manager-gnome

# --- LXQt light apps (the "fusion" part) ---
qterminal
lxqt-runner
featherpad
lximage-qt
pavucontrol-qt
lxqt-notificationd
lxqt-policykit
openbox
obconf-qt

# --- Look & feel ---
arc-theme
papirus-icon-theme
fonts-dejavu
fonts-liberation
fonts-noto
fonts-noto-color-emoji
xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin
plank

# --- Essentials every desktop needs ---
firefox-esr
mousepad
galculator
file-roller
evince
cups
cups-filters
system-config-printer
blueman
bluez
pulseaudio
pulseaudio-module-bluetooth
alsa-utils
upower
acpi
